# The whole ported corpus compiles into one static library, `foundation`.
# Kept as a single flat file list on purpose: this is one artifact drawn from
# many subsystem dirs, and during the carve-down port a flat, greppable,
# prunable list beats a scatter of per-dir fragments. The toplevel executables
# that link this library live in ../bin; the tools and tests in ../tools and
# ../tests.

